  "description": "Typed mathematical-operation contracts with exhaustive OpenMath and Content MathML formula interchange, deterministic CoreCLR execution, and CUDA composition. CUDA execution uses the installed NVIDIA driver and CUDA Toolkit 12.0 or later; the package ships no native binaries.",
  "id": "Supprocom.MathBlocks",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-08T09:32:30.493Z",
  "licenseExpression": "AGPL-3.0-only",
